Dia dhuit. I’ll put up a strong tea of thyme and a spoon of honey for her chest, sure, and tell her to keep the hearth warm and the damp out. If she’s wheezing proper or running a fever, ye’d best send for the doctor in town, but this will ease the worst of it.
