Aye, word travels quick on the wind here, as it always does. I mind my own business with herbs and deliveries, but if the stranger's taken ill or his wife is in labour, he'll find my door soon enough. Le cúnamh Dé, I'll see him right if he needs tending, but otherwise ye'd best ask the parish priest for his particulars.
