Ah, sure 'tis likely just the damp air playing tricks with a shepherd's lantern, or mayhap the sídhe out walking. I'd not trouble myself chasing shadows; stick to the low road when the mist rolls in. If your sleep's been restless from the sight, I'll brew a cup of valerian and chamomile to settle your mind.
